## Enums & Types

### UserType
```typescript
enum UserType {
  PET_OWNER = 'PET_OWNER',
  MANAGER = 'MANAGER',
  VETERINARIAN = 'VETERINARIAN',
  CARE_STAFF = 'CARE_STAFF',
  RECEPTIONIST = 'RECEPTIONIST'
}
```

### AppointmentStatus
```typescript
enum AppointmentStatus {
  PENDING = 'PENDING',
  CONFIRMED = 'CONFIRMED',
  IN_PROGRESS = 'IN_PROGRESS',
  COMPLETED = 'COMPLETED',
  CANCELLED = 'CANCELLED'
}
```

### InvoiceStatus
```typescript
enum InvoiceStatus {
  PENDING = 'PENDING',
  PROCESSING_ONLINE = 'PROCESSING_ONLINE',
  PAID = 'PAID',
  FAILED = 'FAILED'
}
```

### PaymentMethod
```typescript
enum PaymentMethod {
  CASH = 'CASH',
  BANK_TRANSFER = 'BANK_TRANSFER',
  VNPAY = 'VNPAY',
  MOMO = 'MOMO',
  ZALOPAY = 'ZALOPAY'
}
```

### CageSize
```typescript
enum CageSize {
  SMALL = 'SMALL',
  MEDIUM = 'MEDIUM',
  LARGE = 'LARGE'
}
```

### CageStatus
```typescript
enum CageStatus {
  AVAILABLE = 'AVAILABLE',
  OCCUPIED = 'OCCUPIED',
  MAINTENANCE = 'MAINTENANCE',
  RESERVED = 'RESERVED'
}
```

