## 1. Authentication (Auth)

**Base URL:** `/api/auth`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| POST | `/login` | Login | ❌ | All |
| POST | `/logout` | Logout | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/me` | Get current user | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/account/:id` | Get account by ID | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/account/:id/full-profile` | Get account with profile | ✅ | All |
| PUT | `/account/:id/change-password` | Change password | ✅ | All |
| PUT | `/account/:id/activate` | Activate account | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/account/:id/deactivate` | Deactivate account | ✅ | **MANAGER** |

### Request DTOs

#### LoginDto
```typescript
{
  email: string;      // required
  password: string;   // required
}
```

#### ChangePasswordDto
```typescript
{
  oldPassword: string;  // required
  newPassword: string;  // required (min 8 chars)
}
```

### Response DTOs

#### LoginResponseDto
```typescript
{
  accessToken: string;
  tokenType: string;
  user: {
    accountId: number;
    email: string;
    userType: UserType;
    fullName: string;
  }
}
```

---

## 2. Employees

**Base URL:** `/api/employees`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| POST | `/` | Create employee | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/` | Get all employees | ✅ | MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST, PET_OWNER |
| GET | `/veterinarians` | Get all vets | ✅ | All |
| GET | [/care-staff](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/app/dashboard/care-staff) | Get all care staff | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/available` | Get available employees | ✅ | MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST |
| GET | `/by-role/:role` | Get by role | ✅ | MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST |
| GET | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Get by ID | ✅ | Staff |
| PUT | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Update employee | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/available` | Mark available | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/unavailable` | Mark unavailable | ✅ | **MANAGER** |

### CreateEmployeeDto (MANAGER only)
```typescript
{
  email: string;           // required
  password: string;        // required, min 8 chars
  userType: UserType;      // required (VETERINARIAN, CARE_STAFF, RECEPTIONIST, MANAGER)
  fullName: string;        // required
  phoneNumber: string;     // required
  address?: string;        // optional
  hireDate: Date;          // required
  salary: number;          // required, min 0
  
  // Veterinarian-specific
  licenseNumber?: string;  // optional
  expertise?: string;      // optional
  
  // CareStaff-specific
  skills?: string[];       // optional
}
```

### UpdateEmployeeDto
```typescript
{
  fullName?: string;
  phoneNumber?: string;
  address?: string;
  salary?: number;
  licenseNumber?: string;
  expertise?: string;
  skills?: string[];
}
```

