## 3. Pet Owners

**Base URL:** `/api/pet-owners`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| GET | `/` | Get all pet owners | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/search` | Search pet owners | ✅ | Staff |
| POST | `/register` | Register (public) | ❌ | Public |
| GET | `/:accountId` | Get by account ID | ✅ | PET_OWNER (self), MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST |
| PUT | `/:accountId/profile` | Update profile | ✅ | PET_OWNER (self), MANAGER |
| PUT | `/:accountId/preferences` | Update preferences | ✅ | PET_OWNER (self), MANAGER |
| GET | `/:id/appointments` | Get appointments | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/:id/invoices` | Get invoices | ✅ | Staff |

### RegisterPetOwnerDto (Public)
```typescript
{
  email: string;         // required
  password: string;      // required, min 8 chars
  fullName: string;      // required
  phoneNumber: string;   // required
  address?: string;      // optional
}
```

### UpdatePetOwnerDto
```typescript
{
  fullName?: string;
  phoneNumber?: string;
  address?: string;
  preferredContactMethod?: string;
  emergencyContact?: string;
}
```

