## 4. Pets

**Base URL:** `/api/pets`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| GET | `/` | Get all pets | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/me` | Get my pets | ✅ | **PET_OWNER** |
| POST | `/me` | Register pet (owner) | ✅ | **PET_OWNER** |
| GET | `/search` | Search pets | ✅ | Staff |
| POST | `/register` | Register pet (staff) | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| GET | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Get pet by ID | ✅ | All (with access check) |
| GET | `/owner/:ownerId` | Get pets by owner | ✅ | Staff |
| PUT | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Update pet | ✅ | Owner (self), MANAGER |
| DELETE | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Delete pet | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/restore` | Restore pet | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/deleted/:ownerId` | Get deleted pets | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/species/:species` | Get by species | ✅ | Staff |
| PUT | `/:id/transfer` | Transfer ownership | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/:id/medical-history` | Get medical history | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/:id/appointments` | Get appointments | ✅ | Staff |

### CreatePetDto
```typescript
{
  name: string;                 // required
  species: string;              // required (Dog, Cat, Bird, etc.)
  breed?: string;               // optional
  birthDate?: string;           // optional, ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DD)
  gender?: string;              // optional (Male, Female, Unknown)
  weight?: number;              // optional, 0-500 kg
  color?: string;               // optional
  initialHealthStatus?: string; // optional
  specialNotes?: string;        // optional
}
```

