## 5. Appointments

**Base URL:** `/api/appointments`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| POST | `/` | Create appointment | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| POST | `/me` | Create my appointment | ✅ | **PET_OWNER** |
| GET | `/` | Get all appointments | ✅ | All (filtered by role) |
| GET | `/me` | Get my appointments | ✅ | **PET_OWNER** |
| GET | `/by-date-range` | Get by date range | ✅ | MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST |
| GET | `/by-status` | Get by status | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/pet/:petId` | Get by pet | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/employee/:employeeId` | Get by employee | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Get by ID | ✅ | All |
| PUT | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Update | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| DELETE | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Delete | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/confirm` | Confirm | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| PUT | `/:id/start` | Start | ✅ | VETERINARIAN, CARE_STAFF |
| PUT | `/:id/complete` | Complete | ✅ | VETERINARIAN, CARE_STAFF |
| PUT | `/:id/cancel` | Cancel | ✅ | MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST |

### CreateAppointmentDto
```typescript
{
  petId: number;           // required
  employeeId: number;      // required
  serviceId: number;       // required
  appointmentDate: string; // required, YYYY-MM-DD
  startTime: string;       // required, HH:MM
  endTime: string;         // required, HH:MM
  notes?: string;          // optional
  estimatedCost?: number;  // optional
}
```

