## 6. Invoices

**Base URL:** `/api/invoices`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| POST | `/generate` | Generate invoice | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| POST | `/` | Create invoice | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| GET | `/` | Get all invoices | ✅ | All (filtered by role) |
| GET | `/overdue` | Get overdue | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/by-status` | Get by status | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Get by ID | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/number/:invoiceNumber` | Get by number | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/appointment/:appointmentId` | Get by appointment | ✅ | Staff |
| PUT | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Update | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| DELETE | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Delete | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/paid` | Mark as paid | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| PUT | `/:id/failed` | Mark as failed | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/processing` | Mark as processing | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST, PET_OWNER |

### CreateInvoiceDto
```typescript
{
  appointmentId: number;  // required
  discountCode?: string;  // optional
  notes?: string;         // optional, max 500 chars
}
```

