## 7. Payments

**Base URL:** `/api/payments`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| POST | `/` | Process cash payment | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| GET | `/` | Get all payments | ✅ | All |
| POST | `/online/initiate` | Initiate VNPay payment | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST, **PET_OWNER** |
| POST | `/vnpay/callback` | VNPay callback | ❌ | Public (webhook) |
| GET | `/history` | Get payment history | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |
| POST | `/:id/refund` | Process refund | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/:id/receipt` | Generate receipt | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST, **PET_OWNER** |
| GET | `/:id/verify` | Verify payment | ✅ | **MANAGER**, RECEPTIONIST |

### CreatePaymentDto (Cash/Bank)
```typescript
{
  invoiceId: number;
  paymentMethod: PaymentMethod;  // CASH, BANK_TRANSFER
  amount: number;
  transactionId?: string;
  notes?: string;
}
```

### InitiateOnlinePaymentDto (VNPay)
```typescript
{
  invoiceId: number;          // required
  paymentMethod: PaymentMethod; // required (VNPAY, MOMO, ZALOPAY)
  returnUrl?: string;         // optional
  ipAddress?: string;         // optional
  locale?: string;            // optional ('vi' or 'en')
}
```

