## 8. Services

**Base URL:** `/api/services`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| POST | `/` | Create service | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/` | Get all services | ❌ | Public |
| GET | `/search` | Search services | ❌ | Public |
| GET | `/category/:categoryId` | Get by category | ❌ | Public |
| GET | `/price-range` | Get by price range | ❌ | Public |
| GET | `/boarding` | Get boarding services | ❌ | Public |
| GET | `/staff-type/:staffType` | Get by staff type | ❌ | Public |
| GET | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Get by ID | ❌ | Public |
| PUT | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Update service | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| DELETE | [/:id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | Delete service | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| PUT | `/:id/availability` | Toggle availability | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/:id/calculate-price` | Calculate price | ❌ | Public |

### CreateServiceDto (MANAGER only)
```typescript
{
  serviceName: string;        // required
  categoryId: number;         // required
  description?: string;       // optional
  basePrice: number;          // required, min 0
  estimatedDuration: number;  // required, 15-480 minutes
  requiredStaffType: string;  // required ('Veterinarian', 'CareStaff', 'Any')
  isBoardingService?: boolean; // optional, default false
}
```

