### CreateCageDto (MANAGER only)
```typescript
{
  cageNumber: string;   // required, max 20 chars
  size: CageSize;       // required (SMALL, MEDIUM, LARGE)
  location?: string;    // optional, max 50 chars
  dailyRate: number;    // required, min 0
  notes?: string;       // optional
}
```

### AssignCageDto (Check-in)
```typescript
{
  petId: number;            // required
  checkInDate: string;      // required, YYYY-MM-DD
  expectedCheckOutDate: string; // required, YYYY-MM-DD
  notes?: string;           // optional
}
```

