## 12. Medical Records

**Base URL:** `/api/medical-records` and `/api/pets/:petId/vaccinations`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| GET | `/medical-records` | Get all records | ✅ | Staff |
| POST | `/medical-records` | Create record | ✅ | VETERINARIAN |
| GET | `/medical-records/:id` | Get by ID | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/medical-records/pet/:petId` | Get by pet | ✅ | Staff |
| PUT | `/medical-records/:id` | Update record | ✅ | VETERINARIAN |
| GET | `/medical-records/pet/:petId/overdue-followups` | Get overdue | ✅ | Staff |
| GET | `/vaccine-types` | Get all vaccine types | ✅ | Staff |
| POST | `/pets/:petId/vaccinations` | Add vaccination | ✅ | VETERINARIAN |
| GET | `/pets/:petId/vaccinations` | Get vaccinations | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/pets/:petId/vaccinations/upcoming` | Get upcoming | ✅ | All |
| GET | `/pets/:petId/vaccinations/overdue` | Get overdue | ✅ | All |

### CreateMedicalRecordDto
```typescript
{
  petId: number;           // required
  appointmentId?: number;  // optional
  diagnosis: string;       // required
  treatment: string;       // required
  medications?: string;    // optional
  notes?: string;          // optional
  followUpDate?: string;   // optional, YYYY-MM-DD
}
```

### CreateVaccinationDto
```typescript
{
  vaccineTypeId: number;       // required
  vaccinationDate: string;     // required, YYYY-MM-DD
  nextDueDate?: string;        // optional, YYYY-MM-DD
  batchNumber?: string;        // optional
  administeredBy: number;      // required (employee ID)
  notes?: string;              // optional
}
```

---

## 13. Reports (MANAGER ONLY)

**Base URL:** `/api/reports`

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Roles |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|-------|
| GET | `/financial` | Financial report | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/revenue` | Revenue by period | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/appointments` | Appointment statistics | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/services/top` | Top services | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/services/performance` | Service performance | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/employees/workload` | Employee workload | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/customers/retention` | Customer retention | ✅ | **MANAGER** |
| GET | `/dashboard` | Dashboard overview | ✅ | **MANAGER** |

### Query Parameters

#### Financial Report
```
GET /api/reports/financial?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31
```

#### Revenue by Period
```
GET /api/reports/revenue?period=month&year=2025
// period: 'month' | 'quarter' | 'year'
```

#### Top Services
```
GET /api/reports/services/top?limit=10&startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31&sortBy=revenue
// sortBy: 'count' | 'revenue'
```

---

## Response Format

Tất cả responses được wrap trong `ApiResponse`:

```typescript
{
  statusCode: number;     // HTTP status code
  message: string;        // Response message
  data: any;              // Actual data
  path: string;           // Request path
  timestamp: string;      // ISO timestamp
}
```

## Error Handling

| Status Code | Meaning |
|-------------|---------|
| 400 | Bad Request - Validation failed |
| 401 | Unauthorized - Invalid/missing token |
| 403 | Forbidden - Insufficient permissions |
| 404 | Not Found |
| 409 | Conflict - Duplicate/constraint violation |
| 500 | Internal Server Error |

---

## Frontend Design Recommendations

### 1. Manager Dashboard Modules
- **Dashboard**: `/reports/dashboard`
- **Employees**: CRUD + availability management
- **Appointments**: Full lifecycle management
- **Invoices/Payments**: Generate, track, payments
- **Services/Categories**: Full CRUD
- **Schedules**: Staff scheduling
- **Cages**: Boarding management
- **Reports**: Analytics and charts

### 2. Key Features per Role

| Feature | MANAGER | RECEPTIONIST | VETERINARIAN | CARE_STAFF | PET_OWNER |
|---------|---------|--------------|--------------|------------|-----------|
| Create Employee | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Manage Services | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Manage Schedules | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| View Reports | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Process Payment | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Create Appointment | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ (own) |
| Medical Records | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | View |
| Cage Operations | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ |

### 3. Field Mapping Notes

| Frontend Field | Backend Field | Notes |
|----------------|---------------|-------|
| [id](file:///d:/1_Hoc_Tap/1_1_Dai_Hoc/Tai_lieu_ki_1_nam_3/PhuongPhapPhatTrienPhanMemHuo/DoAn/do-an-thu-cung/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx#65-237) | `petId`, `invoiceId`, etc. | Use fallback: `item.petId \|\| item.id` |
| `type` (pet) | `species` | Backend uses `species` |
| `dateOfBirth` | `birthDate` | Backend uses `birthDate` |
| `price` (service) | `basePrice` | Backend uses `basePrice` |
| `medicalHistory` | `initialHealthStatus` | For pets |
| `notes` | `specialNotes` | For pets |

### 4. Common Patterns

```javascript
// ID fallback pattern
const id = item.petId || item.id;

// Date formatting
const dateStr = new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('vi-VN');

// Status badge mapping
const statusMap = {
  PENDING: { color: 'amber', label: 'Chờ xử lý' },
  COMPLETED: { color: 'green', label: 'Hoàn thành' },
  // ...
};
```
